<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sherlock vs Moriarty - Math Hunt</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #0d1117; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
        table { border-collapse: collapse; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #0d1117; padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px; }
        .main-table { width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .banner { width: 100%; max-width: 600px; height: auto; display: block; border: 0; }
        .content-box { padding: 40px 35px; }
        .heading-sub { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #58a6ff; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; }
        .heading { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #f0f6fc; margin: 0 0 25px 0; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.3; }
        .body-text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #c9d1d9; margin: 0 0 20px 0; }
        .details-table { width: 100%; background-color: #0d1117; border-left: 4px solid #ff2a5f; margin: 30px 0; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; border-top: 1px solid #21262d; border-right: 1px solid #21262d; border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d; }
        .details-box { padding: 22px; }
        .detail-item { font-size: 15px; color: #f0f6fc; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .detail-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .btn-container { text-align: center; margin: 35px 0 10px 0; }
        .cta-button { background-color: #ff2a5f; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 15px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.3); }
        .footer { background-color: #0d1117; padding: 35px; text-align: center; color: #8b949e; font-size: 13px; border-top: 1px solid #21262d; }
        .footer a { color: #58a6ff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        .footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <center class="wrapper">
        <table class="main-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
            
            <!-- Banner Section with Your Live Hosted Link -->
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <img 
                        src="https://github.com/Tejrudra007/math-assoc-email/blob/main/math-hunt-banner.png?raw=true"  
                        alt="Sherlock vs Moriarty" 
                        class="banner"
                    >
                </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Content Section -->
            <tr>
                <td class="content-box">
                    <div class="heading-sub">Mathematics Association Presents</div>
                    <h1 class="heading">Sherlock vs Moriarty:<br>The Ultimate Campus Hunt</h1>
                    
                    <p class="body-text">
                        The ultimate mystery on campus is about to unfold. Get ready for an exhilarating campus-wide Treasure Hunt packed with deep enigmas, thrilling twists, and unmatched fun that will keep you guessing at every single turn.
                    </p>

                    <p class="body-text">
                        This year’s hunt is going to be absolutely legendary. Expect mind-blowing clues and cryptic riddles that are far more challenging than ever before, strategically hidden across the entire campus. Bring your sharpest logic—the game is officially on.
                    </p>

                    <!-- Safe Cyber-Noir Logistics Table Structure -->
                    <table class="details-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
                        <tr>
                            <td class="details-box">
                                <div class="detail-item"><span style="color: #ff2a5f;">📅</span> <strong>Date:</strong> TBA</div>
                                <div class="detail-item"><span style="color: #ff2a5f;">⏰</span> <strong>Time:</strong> TBA</div>
                                <div class="detail-item"><span style="color: #ff2a5f;">📍</span> <strong>Venue:</strong> BITS Pilani Campus</div>
                                <div class="detail-item"><span style="color: #ff2a5f;">💰</span> <strong>Prizes:</strong> Coming Soon</div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>

                    <!-- Call To Action Button pointing to the active WhatsApp Community -->
                    <div class="btn-container">
                        <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/L47z0449eRe3G9k0rkLpF5" class="cta-button">Join Official WhatsApp Group</a>
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Professional Management Footer -->
            <tr>
                <td class="footer">
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold; color: #f0f6fc;">Mathematics Association, BITS Pilani</p>
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0;">Connect with us on our socials to crack pre-event clues!</p>
                    <p style="margin: 0;">
                        <a href="https://instagram.com/maths.assoc.bits.pilani/">Follow on Instagram</a> 
                    </p>
                </td>
            </tr>

        </table>
    </center>

</body>
</html>
